  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra resultatstyrningen hos den tadzjikiska regeringen samt att st&#xe4;rka det nationella &#xe4;garskapet av landets &quot;Poverty Reduction Strategy&quot; (PRS). Projektet implementeras av Asiatiska Utvecklingsbanken (ADB).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to improve the results management capacity in central parts of the Tajik Government and to strengthen national ownership of the Poverty Reduction Strategy (PRS) and will be implemented by the Asian Development Bank (ADB).</narrative>
